Notebook[{Cell["R7: exact algebraic verification", "Title"],
  Cell["Choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook to run the complete \
verification. All parameters, definitions and verification commands are \
contained in this file. The calculations use exact rational arithmetic. The \
final summary reports PASS only when both estimates have been verified.",
   "Text"], Cell["The two assertions are the nonlinear estimate at the 22 \
endpoints of the parameter table, and the terminal spectral estimate \
throughout 2.4962 <= sigma <= 5/2. The geometric and analytic arguments of \
the paper are outside the scope of this notebook.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"BeginPackage", "[", "\"R7Algebra`\"", "]"}],
      ";"}]], "Input"],
